  description: 'You cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck, except Synchro Monsters.
    You can only use each of the following effects of "Elfnote Power Patron" once
    per turn. During the Main Phase (Quick Effect): You can target 1 monster in your
    center Main Monster Zone; increase its Level by 3 (until the end of this turn),
    then immediately after this effect resolves, you can Synchro Summon 1 "Elfnote"
    Synchro Monster or 1 "Junora the Power Patron of Tuning". If this card is sent
    to the GY as Synchro Material: You can add 1 "Elfnote" card from your Deck to
    your hand.'
